itative rights are not established.\",\n      \"claimTextType\": \"qualified_reader_paraphrase_not_verbatim_source_quote\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        {\n          \"sourceId\": \"europe-china-ownership:EC-S01\",\n          \"locator\": \"Printed p.76 (PDF page 77), table and note 1\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"dates\": {\n        \"snapshot\": \"2024-12-31\",\n        \"statement\": \"2025-03-19\",\n        \"publication\": \"2025-04-08\",\n        \"publicationVerification\": \"Recorded packet metadata; live HKEX publication listing not independently replayed\"\n      },\n      \"qualifications\": [\n        \"One Tencent issuer report supports all three December statements; HKEX hosting is not independent authorship.\",\n        \"Three typed assertions do not certify three immediate-parent hops, a continuous path or a payment flow.\",\n        \"Naspers, Prosus and MIH deemed interests refer to the same share block and must never be added.\",\n        \"March Prosus percentages cannot be carried into December or multiplied into a look-through percentage.\"\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": [\n        \"December upstream direct-holder identity and quantitative rights\",\n        \"Exact ownership start/end dates\",\n        \"Independent same-date corroboration\"\n      ],\n      \"moneyStages\": [],\n      \"aggregationPermitted\": false,\n      \"graphEligible\": false,\n      \"pathEligible\": false,\n      \"publicationStatus\": \"awaiting-parent-content-review\",\n      \"criticismResponseIds\": [],\n      \"directLegalParentAtSnapshot\": null,\n      \"sourceRecordPointer\": {\n        \"file\": \"candidate-edges.json\",\n        \"id\": \"EC-E01\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"EC-E02\",\n      \"packet\": \"europe-china-ownership\",\n      \"claimText\": \"Tencent describes MIH Internet Holdings B.V. as a wholly-owned subsidiary of Prosus at 31 December 2024. Direct ownership is evidenced only at the separate 31 March 2024 date; December direct legal parenthood remains unestablished.\",\n      \"claimTextType\": \"qualified_reader_paraphrase_not_verbatim_source_quote\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        {\n          \"sourceId\": \"europe-china-ownership:EC-S01\",\n          \"locator\": \"Printed p.76 (PDF page 77), table and note 1\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"dates\": {\n        \"snapshot\": \"2024-12-31\",\n        \"statement\": \"2025-03-19\",\n        \"publication\": \"2025-04-08\",\n        \"publicationVerification\": \"Recorded packet metadata; live HKEX publication listing not independently replayed\"\n      },\n      \"qualifications\": [\n        \"One Tencent issuer report supports all three December statements; HKEX hosting is not independent authorship.\",\n        \"Three typed assertions do not certify three immediate-parent hops, a continuous path or a payment flow.\",\n        \"Naspers, Prosus and MIH deemed interests refer to the same share block and must never be added.\",\n        \"March Prosus percentages cannot be carried into December or multiplied into a look-through percentage.\"\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": [\n        \"December upstream direct-holder identity and quantitative rights\",\n        \"Exact ownership start/end dates\",\n        \"Independent same-date corroboration\"\n      ],\n      \"moneyStages\": [],\n      \"aggregationPermitted\": false,\n      \"graphEligible\": false,\n      \"pathEligible\": false,\n      \"publicationStatus\": \"awaiting-parent-content-review\",\n      \"criticismResponseIds\": [],\n      \"directLegalParentAtSnapshot\": null,\n      \"sourceRecordPointer\": {\n        \"file\": \"candidate-edges.json\",\n        \"id\": \"EC-E02\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"EC-E03\",\n      \"packet\": \"europe-china-ownership\",\n      \"claimText\": \"Tencent discloses MIH Internet Holdings B.V.'s corporate long interest of 2,214,863,800 shares, approximately 24.01% of 9,224,914,953 total issued shares at 31 December 2024; t